---
---

<section id="origin" class="py-24 bg-[#050505] text-white border-t border-white/10">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8">

    <!-- Headline Statement -->
    <div class="max-w-4xl mb-16">
      <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-[#c5a059] font-bold block mb-3">
        Origin & Terroir
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight leading-[0.95] mb-8">
        ELEVATING COFFEE FROM A DAILY ROUTINE TO AN <span class="font-serif italic font-normal text-[#c5a059]">extraordinary art.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg sm:text-2xl font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-300 font-sans">
        Nestled high on the mineral-laden slopes of Turrialba Volcano in Cartago, Costa Rica, our estate merges native shade-grown agroforestry with precision micro-batch roasting.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Side-by-Side Overlay Media Section -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 my-16">

      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="relative group overflow-hidden bg-[#0d0d0d] border border-white/10 text-white min-h-[500px] flex flex-col justify-end p-8 sm:p-12 hover:border-[#c5a059]/60 transition-all duration-500">
        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511537190424-bbbab87ac5eb?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop"
          alt="Turrialba Volcanic Estate"
          loading="lazy"
          class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover opacity-50 group-hover:scale-105 group-hover:opacity-70 transition-all duration-700 filter contrast-125"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#050505] via-[#050505]/40 to-transparent"></div>

        <div class="relative z-10">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-[#c5a059] font-bold block mb-2">
            Volcanic Chemistry
          </span>
          <h3 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight mb-4">
            Volcanic Soil Terroir
          </h3>
          <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base font-light mb-6 max-w-lg leading-relaxed">
            High above the cloud line at 1,850m elevation, active volcanic ash enriches the soil with essential minerals, resulting in dense cherries packed with complex sugars and floral notes.
          </p>
          <a href="#timeline" class="inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-[#c5a059] text-black font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-bold hover:bg-[#e6d7c3] transition-colors">
            Discover Process &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="relative group overflow-hidden bg-[#0d0d0d] border border-white/10 text-white min-h-[500px] flex flex-col justify-end p-8 sm:p-12 hover:border-[#c5a059]/60 transition-all duration-500">
        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1497515114629-f71d768fd07c?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop"
          alt="Coffee Roasting Precision"
          loading="lazy"
          class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover opacity-50 group-hover:scale-105 group-hover:opacity-70 transition-all duration-700 filter contrast-125"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#050505] via-[#050505]/40 to-transparent"></div>

        <div class="relative z-10">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-[#c5a059] font-bold block mb-2">
            Artisanal Precision
          </span>
          <h3 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight mb-4">
            Micro-Batch Roasting
          </h3>
          <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base font-light mb-6 max-w-lg leading-relaxed">
            Every harvest lot is custom-profiled and roasted in 2kg small batches with thermal sensors, preserving delicate varietal aromatics and vibrant origin characteristics.
          </p>
          <a href="#menu" class="inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-transparent border border-[#c5a059] text-[#e6d7c3] font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-bold hover:bg-[#c5a059] hover:text-black transition-colors">
            Shop Micro-Lots &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
